        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVBEL, Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Plate combined with the Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. Unencumbered by complexity, this clean contemporary design is unique in decorative door hardware. Classically styled, the simplicity of the Fifth Avenue Plate With Bellagio Lever will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. The wave shaped lever is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVBEL Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-plate.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BEL-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Bellagio Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plate, Grandeur FAVBEL",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVBEL, Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plate - Fifth Avenue Plate combined with the Bellagio Lever's simple lines draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. Unencumbered by complexity, this clean contemporary design is unique in decorative door hardware. Classically styled, the simplicity of the Fifth Avenue Plate With Bellagio Lever will enhance the beauty of your home no matter if your home is styled contemporarily or traditionally. The wave shaped lever is both elegant and timeless. Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The classic style of the Fifth Avenue Series draws attention to the stoutness created by its designers. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Bellagio Lever With Fifth Avenue Plates, GRA-FAVBEL, Grandeur FAVBEL, Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Entry Set With Bellagio Levers, Grandeur FAVBEL Simple wave levers, fifth avenue Bellagio Levers,"
